WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.958
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:00.958 --> 00:00:02.970
- I mean,
(Arsema laughs)

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.556
I don't have long enough with
you and I'm sad about it.

00:00:06.556 --> 00:00:07.410
(Arsema laughs)

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.260
But I'm, so, we're all fans
of "Bridgerton" in general.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.960
Just, before even this show existed,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.193
but I have to tell you,

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.640
this series gets better.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.637
I watched the first series, I was like,

00:00:18.637 --> 00:00:20.730
"No way they're gonna do
it with the second one."

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.177
I was like, "Oh my God!"
(Arsema laughs)

00:00:22.177 --> 00:00:24.300
"No way they're gonna do
it with the third one."

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.100
This is my favorite one.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.030
- [Arsema] No way!
- It is--

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:29.550
- Wow!
- So, no, no, way, way, way.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.930
It is so good.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.190
So tell us,

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.060
or I know who you play,

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.200
but tell everybody who you play

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.270
and like what it's really
about your character?

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.150
- So I play a young Queen Charlotte.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.560
Queen Charlotte is obviously,

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.210
the queen in "Bridgerton".

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:43.260
So I play the younger version

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.417
of Golda Rosheuvel's portrayal of her.

00:00:46.417 --> 00:00:47.250
- [Corey] There she is.
- [India] There she is!

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:51.330
- Oh my God!
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.280
looking phenomenal.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.840
- She's pretty cool.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.880
- And that's her.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:00.750
She's pretty, yeah, she's
17, has come from Germany.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.460
- Kind of a progressive mind for the time.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:03.293
- [India] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:03.293 --> 00:01:04.126
- [India] Completely.
- Yeah.

00:01:04.126 --> 00:01:06.390
- And very kind of inquisitive
and really lovely to play

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.850
someone who's not just one-dimensional.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.230
She's got so many different layers

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:12.240
and yeah, very, very lucky

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:13.920
to be a part of it and to play her.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:14.880
- And it's intense.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.890
Y'all's different, yeah,
I was like, "What?"

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:17.723
- [India] Yeah.
- Okay

00:01:17.723 --> 00:01:19.050
tell everybody who's here, Lady Danbury?

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:19.883
- Yes!
- [Kelly] Your version.

00:01:19.883 --> 00:01:22.710
- Yeah, I'm young Lady
Agatha Danbury in the show.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:24.510
You kind of see her

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.110
in a much different
version than you saw in--

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:28.523
(audience applauds and cheers)
(laughs) Yes, yeah!

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.010
So like in "Bridgerton",

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:35.430
she's this extremely
powerful woman, you know,

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.320
you see her with her cane and her hat.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:42.270
And then to see her in this
show, she is just not there yet.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.130
And you kind of see her become that.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:46.440
So to see what a journey is like

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.560
in a young black woman is
so just exciting to play.

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:50.730
- And the pressure and the weight.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:54.720
I love how this story,
it has a lot of parallels

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:57.390
for just like life now too, you know?

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:58.710
And there's a lot of messaging in there.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:01:59.940
Not in a way that beats you over the head,

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:02.337
but tells a story to where you
make, it's thought provoking.

00:02:02.337 --> 00:02:03.170
- Yeah.

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:04.050
- I just love how you see her

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:06.540
in a completely different light, you know?

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:07.677
You did a great job.

00:02:07.677 --> 00:02:08.670
- [India] Didn't she?
- It was really, really great.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:09.708
Yes.
- Thank you. (giggles)

00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:12.660
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:15.570
Corey, you can tell everybody
who you play, but oh my gosh.

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:18.180
I feel like you, out of
the entire cast, just,

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.470
they put you through the
wringer emotionally, like.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:22.020
- Yeah. Yeah. It wasn't easy.

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:22.853
- [Kelly] No.

00:02:22.853 --> 00:02:25.170
- Yeah. these guys made
it very easy, easier.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.400
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.303
Not so much India.

00:02:28.288 --> 00:02:29.449
(all laughing)

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:30.390
No, no, no.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:31.980
No, it was great, yeah.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.740
He is charming, he has
that string to his bow,

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:37.170
but he, the man that he, there he is.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.003
- Yeah King George.

00:02:38.003 --> 00:02:38.836
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:02:38.836 --> 00:02:40.437
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:02:40.437 --> 00:02:41.345
- Sorry, that,

00:02:41.345 --> 00:02:42.738
I wasn't asking.
- And you play King George,

00:02:42.738 --> 00:02:43.680
yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.820
Just looking fantastic.

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.680
Here's the thing, I know
y'all all look beautiful

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.700
and gorgeous and whatever.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.050
How uncomfortable were you?

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.553
Don't lie. (chuckles)

00:02:51.553 --> 00:02:54.138
- Me and Arsema are like, where
do we go, where do we start?

00:02:54.138 --> 00:02:55.230
- Yeah, there's so many choices.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.778
The shoes, the skirts
themselves were heavy.

00:02:57.778 --> 00:02:58.611
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.300
- The corsets and then the wigs.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.133
- Yeah, yeah yeah.

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:03.060
- Which were like another good 10 pounds.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.610
- I mean, they did a great
job. You look incredible.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:06.443
But I was like,

00:03:06.443 --> 00:03:08.291
there is no way they're
not crying deep inside.

00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:09.124
(Arsema laughs)

